<id/12/1265/#concept> a <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type>, skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Berries Yellow"@en ;
    skos:broader <id/grp/grp_natural_dyestuffs/#concept> ;
    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_natural_dyestuffs): Yellow berries are the dye berries of Rhamnus infectorius (Simmonds 1892 s.v. YELLOW BERRIES: 'imported ... from the South of Europe and the Levant, for the use of dyers'); Layer-1 origin 'Turkey Proper', in cwt. Layer-1 observations: 15 rows, 1800–1866. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×9; KEW_CUST 5 ×6. Units: CWTS (Hundredweights) ×15. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×4; Other Parts → United Kingdom ×3; Turkey Proper → United Kingdom ×3; Italy → United Kingdom ×1."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <id/scheme/#resource> ;
    skos:notation "1265" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Berries Yellow"@en ;
